            <a name="DESC">
            <b>Character:</b> Level 65 halfling rogue with 447 AA points.<br>
HP = 6958<br>
AC = 1784<br>
ATK = 1562<br>
Self Haste = 46%<br>
Raid Buffed HP = 9300+
<p>
This is arguably the most powerful rogue on the Rallos Zek server. Almost 7k hps unbuffed/9.3k hps raid buffed, 2/5 Offensive Enhancement Leadership Group AA, over 300 in all resists, and the more aa's than any rogue on RZ. Best rogue piercing weapons in the game (GoD dagger 23/20 w/ +1 dmg augment and Time:Inny Dagger 20/19 w/ 150 dd augment) to combine for incredibly fast damage. Backstab (almost 1600 non-disc single, over 3100 disc single). 46% self hasted. Maxed poison making (250 w/ grand master assassin's seal). 
<p>
<b>Misc items:</b> Worker Sledgemallet (OT hammer), The Binden Concerrentia (gate neck), Bracer of the Hidden, Velium Coldain Insignia Ring (8th ring), Shrunken Goblin Skull Earring (atk buff), Necrotic Diving Device (corpse locator), Bloody Ancille's Pouch (arrow maker), Stanos' Wicked Leggins (poison maker), Giant Black Drum (fastest Drogmor), Crown of Deceit (wood elf mask), Mask of Deception (dark elf mask), Iksar Hide Mask (iksar mask), Mask of Tinkering (gnome mask), Burnoose of the Halfbreed (half-elf mask). 50k plat in bank.
<p>
<b>Flags and Keys:</b> This character is fully flagged, including Elemental Planes, Plane of Time, and Kod'Taz (GoD trials 1-7 completed). Has all current expansions, enabled. Is able to participate in all LdoN Raids, and has the following Keys: Sleeper’s Tomb, Vex Thal, Howling Stones, Old Sebilis, Emperor Ssra, Key to Ragrax Stronghold of the 12 (Earth B), Key to lower Lxanvom (Bertoxxulus area), Bastion of Thunder Tower Key, Arbitor of Earth Caves Key in PoE. Has killed all Sol Ro tower Mini's for entrance into Sol Ro's chamber. 
<p>
<b>Magelo:</b> http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=733063 
<p>
If you are looking for insane pvp or a stealthy assassin, this is your man. Very Deadly toon. He can drop medium geared casters in a single blow! He has a great reputation and has always been anti-pk. There is also a level 60 epic druid in ornate gear on the account for pl'ing, porting etc. I am the original owner and can mail 
the CD's/keys upon request. I will transfer to your server of choice for an additional $75. Not accepting trades. I accept Verified Paypal, Western Union, or 
Cashier's Check/Money Orders. No personal checks. You are buying my time invested in EQ. By bidding on this item you are stating that you are not affiliated with any government agency, Verant Interactive, Sony Computer Entertainment America, or ANTI-Piracy group.
